rm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 为候选基数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\kappa\">\\(\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\kappa\\)</span> 的定义域包含有限基数，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6c973042c939008f\" href=\"?note=6c973042c939008f\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-saturation\">17-df-cardinal-saturation</a>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\kappa\">\\(\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\kappa\\)</span> (saturation predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6c973042c939008f\" href=\"?note=6c973042c939008f\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-saturation\">17-df-cardinal-saturation</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sat}_\\kappa\">\\(\\operatorname{Sat}_\\kappa\\)</span> (notation defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sat}_\\kappa(\\mathfrak{A})\n\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\n\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\kappa(\\mathfrak{A}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sat}_\\kappa(\\mathfrak{A})\n\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\n\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\kappa(\\mathfrak{A}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The canonical definition quantifies over parameter sets of cardinality below\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> and complete <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>-types over those sets.  It does not compare the finite\narity <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> of a type with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-cardinal-saturation","status":"resolved","id":"6c973042c939008f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-cardinal-saturation]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-cardinal-saturation","status":"resolved","id":"6c973042c939008f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$，$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$，$\\kappa$ 为候选基数；$\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\kappa$ 的定义域包含有限基数，见 [[17-df-cardinal-saturation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-cardinal-saturation","status":"resolved","id":"6c973042c939008f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\kappa$ (saturation predicate, see [[17-df-cardinal-saturation]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sat}_\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sat}_\\kappa(\\mathfrak{A})\n\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\n\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\kappa(\\mathfrak{A}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":1298,"backlinks":[{"id":"878c65aa33f0602e","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Sat}_\\kappa$ ($\\kappa$-saturation predicate, see [[17-df-saturation-notation]])"},{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-112","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-compactness]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-lowenheim-skolem]]\n[[17-df-aleph-one-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-